---
title: Calldiff
description: Diff function call stacks across git commits, AST-based across 23 languages.
github: https://github.com/tanishqkancharla/calldiff
last_edited: August 20, 2026
status: in-progress
tags: [typescript]
---

Calldiff is like `git diff`, but for who-calls-whom. Built for agentic review when line diffs bury the shape of a change.

```bash
npx calldiff@latest
```
